      }
    },
    "奖品仅限站内虚拟物品，例如能量、徽章、头衔或社区身份。不得以现金、实物、礼品卡或任何可兑换站外权益的物品作为奖品。违反规则的抽奖可以通过帖子上的举报入口反馈，由管理团队处理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prizes are limited to on-site virtual items such as energy, badges, titles or community roles. Cash, physical goods, gift cards and anything redeemable for benefits off the site are not permitted. Giveaways that break these rules can be reported from the post itself and are handled by the moderation team."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "奖品仅限站内虚拟物品（能量、徽章、头衔等），不得为现金、实物或可兑换站外权益的物品。" : {
      "comment" : "A disclaimer for lottery prizes.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prizes are limited to on-site virtual items (energy, badges, titles and the like) and may not be cash, physical goods, or anything redeemable off the site."
          }
        }
      }
    },
